  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我不转过身来就这样跟你说话，\n真是很抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D8F6C8FC78EAB67655C318FD968378DDF4F608BF48BDDFF0C000A771F662F5F8862B16B49300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的腰咔擦一声，痛到不行……\n这就是所谓的闪到腰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176848170549464E64E0058F0FF0C75DB52304E0D884C20262026000A8FD95C31662F62408C13768495EA52308170300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我痛得动弹不得，\n想叫人也痛苦得叫不出声。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621175DB5F9752A85F394E0D5F97FF0C000A60F353EB4EBA4E5F75DB82E65F9753EB4E0D51FA58F0300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "上次闪到腰的时候，\n是宝可梦的招式给我治好的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0A6B2195EA52308170768465F65019FF0C000A662F5B9D53EF68A6768462DB5F0F7ED962116CBB597D7684300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我记得……\n是叫做<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>蛸固<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的招式。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BB05F9720262026000A662F53EB505A00100002FF00000686F856FA00100002FF000000768462DB5F0F300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "非常抱歉，\n请对我使出蛸固这个招式吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>八爪武师<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>这种宝可梦就能学会。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975E5E3862B16B49FF0C000A8BF75BF962114F7F51FA86F856FA8FD94E2A62DB5F0F5427300200100001BE00000A00100002FF000006516B722A6B665E0800100002FF0000008FD979CD5B9D53EF68A65C3180FD5B664F1A300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就是……\n我最后的希望……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C31662F20262026000A62116700540E76845E0C671B2026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托了……请让<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>八爪武师\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>对我使出<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>蛸固<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>吧……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584E86202620268BF78BA900100002FF000006516B722A6B665E08000A00100002FF0000005BF962114F7F51FA00100002FF00000686F856FA00100002FF00000054272026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554A554AFF01FF0100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "腰痛和中招的痛！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "817075DB548C4E2D62DB768475DBFF01FF0100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被固定住的地方渐渐舒缓了……\n虽说腰痛的时候不该按摩的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB56FA5B9A4F4F7684573065B96E106E1082127F134E8620262026000A867D8BF4817075DB768465F650194E0D8BE5630964697684300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不对，这个蛸固……\n是因为避开了患部，所以才有效果吗……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5BF9FF0C8FD94E2A86F856FA20262026000A662F56E04E3A907F5F004E8660A390E8FF0C62404EE5624D67096548679C54172026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蛸固让我闪到的腰\n渐渐地没那么痛了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "86F856FA8BA9621195EA523076848170000A6E106E1057306CA190A34E4875DB4E862026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你！\n你真是个善良的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF01000A4F60771F662F4E2A5584826F76844EBA300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然蛸固的威力强大，\n比闪到腰还痛就是了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713686F856FA76845A01529B5F3A5927FF0C000A6BD495EA523081708FD875DB5C31662F4E862026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "八爪武师，也谢谢你！\n蛸固的威力好猛啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516B722A6B665E08FF0C4E5F8C228C224F60FF01000A86F856FA76845A01529B597D731B554A2026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "八爪武师……不对，\n乌贼王，也谢谢你！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n蛸固的威力好猛啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516B722A6B665E08202620264E0D5BF9FF0C000A4E4C8D3C738BFF0C4E5F8C228C224F60FF0100100001BE00000A86F856FA76845A01529B597D731B554A2026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "腰是重中之重。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8170662F91CD4E2D4E4B91CD300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "腰一闪，什么都做不了。\n连做心理准备的时间都不会给。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81704E0095EAFF0C4EC04E4890FD505A4E0D4E863002000A8FDE505A5FC3740651C65907768465F695F490FD4E0D4F1A7ED9300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "腰总是闪得很突然，\n为了不要到那时才知道后悔，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n希望你能珍惜每分每秒，用心生活。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8170603B662F95EA5F975F887A817136FF0C000A4E3A4E864E0D8981523090A365F6624D77E59053540E6094FF0C00100001BE00000A5E0C671B4F6080FD73CD60DC6BCF52066BCF79D2FF0C75285FC3751F6D3B300200100002011401BA0000",
